# Environment Variables — FitPulse Elite

Copy this file to `.env` and fill in your values.
Never commit `.env` — it is in `.gitignore`.

```bash
cp .env.example .env
```

# ─── AI & ML API Keys ────────────────────────────────────────

# Anthropic Claude — AI Coach conversational responses
VITE_ANTHROPIC_API_KEY=sk-ant-xxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxx

# Clarifai — Computer Vision food recognition
VITE_CLARIFAI_PAT=xxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxx

# Google Gemini — Workout generation fallback / second opinion
VITE_GEMINI_API_KEY=AIzaSyxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxx
